## Key Features Implemented

### Visual Design
✅ **Liquid Glass Aesthetic**: Multi-layered glassmorphism with 24-26px blur effects
✅ **Gradient System**: White → #E9F7FF → #D0ECFF background gradient
✅ **Color Palette**: #2F80ED (primary) and #0AA1FF (accent) blue tones
✅ **Depth & Shadows**: Multi-layer shadows with inset highlights for 3D glass effect
✅ **Border System**: Semi-transparent white borders (rgba(255,255,255,0.2-0.3))

### Animations
✅ **Spring Physics**: Natural bouncy animations on all interactions
✅ **Entrance Animations**: Staggered fade-in with slide effects
✅ **Button Feedback**: Scale on hover/tap with spring transitions
✅ **Play/Pause Transitions**: Rotating scale animations with AnimatePresence
✅ **Pulsing Glows**: Breathing effect around play button when active
✅ **Waveform Animation**: Dynamic height changes with glow effects

### Interactive Elements
✅ **Animated Waveform**: 40 bars with gradient fill and active bar glow
✅ **Progress Bar**: Buffered region + gradient progress + animated thumb
✅ **View Switcher**: Morphing background indicator with layoutId
✅ **Control States**: Shuffle, repeat (off/all/one), like with visual feedback
✅ **Micro-interactions**: Heart bounce, button scales, hover glows

### Accessibility
✅ **Contrast Ratios**: Proper text contrast on glass backgrounds
✅ **Interactive Feedback**: Clear hover/active states
✅ **Touch Targets**: Minimum 44x44px touch areas
✅ **Visual Hierarchy**: Clear information architecture

---

## Animation Specifications

**Spring Configuration**:
- `stiffness: 400, damping: 17` - Snappy button feedback
- `stiffness: 300, damping: 20` - Icon transitions
- `stiffness: 200, damping: 20` - Card entrance animations

**Timing**:
- Entrance animations: 0.5s base + staggered delays (0.1-0.6s)
- Hover feedback: Instant with spring physics
- Icon transitions: 0.3s spring
- Pulsing effects: 2-3s infinite ease-in-out

